  "goodToKnow": "Verdammt is a common mild curse: Verdammt! means Damn! The stronger version is Verdammt noch mal! As an adverb, it intensifies: verdammt gut, verdammt kalt. It comes from verdammen, to condemn or damn, as in zur Untätigkeit verdammt (condemned to inaction). In films, verdammt often translates damn or bloody. It's rude but not obscene, so it's acceptable in casual company."
